{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower of Timor is a first-person exploration and survival game where a normal shopping trip traps you in an infinite store. There are no weapons and no way to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is patrolled by staff who appear normal at first \u2014 but their arms and legs are stretched unnaturally, and they move in ways that don\u2019t feel right. You must also manage your hunger, finding food to survive as you search for the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful night brings greater danger, as the staff become more aggressive and the aisles even more disorienting. Explore, survive, and try to escape a store that seems to have no end.<br><br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <br><br><br><br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673210?t=1761711701","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673210?t=1761711701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673210/5df30221e554deb67ab544708ce2121d62893923/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761711701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673210/5df30221e554deb67ab544708ce2121d62893923/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761711701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature themes include; death "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower of Timor is a first-person exploration and survival game where a normal shopping trip traps you in an infinite store. There are no weapons and no way to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></